{"id":"n71227-1-7","stage":1,"title":"저번 · 那次","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71227-1-7-1","ko":"이거 저번 주에도 봤던 영화잖아.","zh":"这不就是上周也看过的那部电影吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이거","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이거：这个","readings":[{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71128","senseId":"1","lemma":"이거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}},{"text":"저번","meaning":"那次","explanation":"저번：那次","readings":[{"term":"저번","audio":"/audio/cfbadf011c981e92e9cc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71227","senseId":"1","lemma":"저번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저번","audio":"/audio/cfbadf011c981e92e9cc.mp3"}},{"text":"주에도","meaning":"周，星期","explanation":"주：周，星期；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46811","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주에도","audio":"/audio/7c32849045b0d44ed948.mp3"}},{"text":"봤던","meaning":"看，观看，观赏","explanation":"보다：看，观看，观赏；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봤던","audio":"/audio/e508150ee589f42eb4fc.mp3"}},{"text":"영화잖아.","meaning":"电影","explanation":"영화：电影；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"영화","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71624","senseId":"1","lemma":"영화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"영화잖아","audio":"/audio/d45854b62d04618b3965.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4515223b0fb4ed4e","term":"이거","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3","entryId":"71128","definition":"指代与说话人较近的、或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이거"]},{"id":"cfbadf011c981e92","term":"저번","zh":"那次","audio":"/audio/cfbadf011c981e92e9cc.mp3","entryId":"71227","definition":"说话时刻之前已经过去的顺序或时间。","pronunciation":["저ː번"]},{"id":"6234d5b178a8b258","term":"주","zh":"周，星期","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3","entryId":"46811","definition":"从周一至周日七天为一周期计算的时间单位。","pronunciation":["주"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看，观看，观赏","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛享受或欣赏某个对象。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"1f0a9d32bbf42b6d","term":"영화","zh":"电影","audio":"/audio/1f0a9d32bbf42b6d556f.mp3","entryId":"71624","definition":"含有一定的意义，拍摄移动的对象，用放映机投影到银幕上看的综合性艺术。","pronunciation":["영화"]}],"audio":"/audio/6352124cf21664a052eb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71227-1-7-2","ko":"아, 그랬었나? 왜 기억이 안 나지?","zh":"啊，是吗？怎么想不起来了呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아,","meaning":"哦","explanation":"아：哦","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"4","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}},{"text":"그랬었나?","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；었었：回顾已经结束或与现在情况有区别的过去。；나：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그랬었나","audio":"/audio/be97323147f3ad800142.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"기억이","meaning":"记着，记住","explanation":"기억：记着，记住；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기억","audio":"/audio/603669bd762779d98169.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38812","senseId":"1","lemma":"기억","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기억이","audio":"/audio/3e1df3e1fc3b5f222699.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"나지?","meaning":"想起，想到","explanation":"나다：想起，想到；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"21","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나지","audio":"/audio/e3dab811a03673c55137.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"哦","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"由不知道而转向醒悟时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"603669bd762779d9","term":"기억","zh":"记着，记住","audio":"/audio/603669bd762779d98169.mp3","entryId":"38812","definition":"不忘记或重新想起以前的模样、事实、知识、经验等。","pronunciation":["기억"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"想起，想到","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"想法或记忆等浮现。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8b6032170952151ce866.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.9,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71227","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","d